                                        "glosses": [
                                            "das/der eine genauso wie das/der andere"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "kopulative",
                                            "nebenordnende",
                                            "verbindende Konjunktion; verbindet zwei gleichwertige Dinge/Aussagen/Aspekte und steht zusammen mit als/wie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfa43000-9f19-446f-8661-856fc0d3b8e8",
                                                "sense_id": "1f98a536-1fdd-3152-b816-d05cc2dad488",
                                                "text": "Sowohl sie als auch er sprechen Englisch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "feabb615-1e2d-4c9c-821b-dd903be3bdd4",
                                                "sense_id": "1f98a536-1fdd-3152-b816-d05cc2dad488",
                                                "text": "Sie sprechen sowohl Englisch wie Französisch."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4c80b30-ebe8-455f-8a6b-8cb894dd204e",
                                                "sense_id": "1f98a536-1fdd-3152-b816-d05cc2dad488",
                                                "text": "„Diese Art von Wörtern erscheint im Österreichischen Wörterbuch sowohl als Lemma wie auch als Variante zu einem Lemma in der Lemmaerläuterung oder -definition.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a77e2d59-d290-4c51-bd9c-ac8579d9857b",
                        "source_entry_id": "e0f0f1c5-220e-33d8-bf41-ef2bf3f4f3c1",
                        "source_sense_id": "4dd18e83-3f45-3471-a923-6456caa58588",
                        "source_sense_description": "evenzeer",
                        "target_lang_word": "both",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "both",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b04ec04c-a0be-360b-89c5-fd868d8c092c",
                                        "entry_id": "2e35698f-4262-3222-9c6f-a95759bbcea5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Each of the two; one and the other; referring to two individuals or items."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59adacab-62b8-45aa-9e2c-4d457a93defb",
                                                "sense_id": "b04ec04c-a0be-360b-89c5-fd868d8c092c",
                                                "text": "Both (the/my) children are such dolls."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14ff1e3b-6857-4b33-b93c-56753c88190d",
                                                "sense_id": "b04ec04c-a0be-360b-89c5-fd868d8c092c",
                                                "text": "Which one do you need? ―I need both of them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "424ca7de-0f68-45bc-a971-0d1e9479b153",
                                                "sense_id": "b04ec04c-a0be-360b-89c5-fd868d8c092c",
                                                "text": "Abraham took sheep and oxen, and gave them unto Abimelech; and both of them made a covenant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9369373-f2e4-427c-a08d-0291f4663657",
                                                "sense_id": "b04ec04c-a0be-360b-89c5-fd868d8c092c",
                                                "text": "He will not bear the loss of his rank, because he can bear the loss of his estate; but he will bear both, because he is prepared for both."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b2d357-ec3c-4bf6-b87d-2ce396b0d33e",
                                                "sense_id": "b04ec04c-a0be-360b-89c5-fd868d8c092c",
                                                "text": "Around a third of both Black and White respondents said they believed the opposition Labour Party to be institutionally racist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd47f036-792e-4522-8ede-f7329c641fda",
                                                "sense_id": "b04ec04c-a0be-360b-89c5-fd868d8c092c",
                                                "text": "The proof (Tables 9 and 10) of idempotence for both OR and AND follows from examining the definition of each operation under the constraint that both inputs have the same value."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "both",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3795bc40-33e6-370e-bed9-5f36b9a132b6",
                                        "entry_id": "175ec947-ce32-36b7-be93-daec7591d394",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Each of the two, or of the two kinds."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75069dfc-785f-4355-8199-99b09cb03b50",
                                                "sense_id": "3795bc40-33e6-370e-bed9-5f36b9a132b6",
                                                "text": "Did you want this one or that one? ―Give me both."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b59b126a-0c1c-4169-b9b0-a1582b8ef84d",
                                                "sense_id": "3795bc40-33e6-370e-bed9-5f36b9a132b6",
                                                "text": "They were both here."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40c6a9db-8cc4-4b54-9b28-563512e837c4",
                                                "sense_id": "3795bc40-33e6-370e-bed9-5f36b9a132b6",
                                                "text": "I've already lost both (of) my parents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d814f14-e91f-4c66-b753-be7dd0794f5f",
                                                "sense_id": "3795bc40-33e6-370e-bed9-5f36b9a132b6",
                                                "text": "Irregular bedtimes may disrupt healthy brain development in young children, according to a study of intelligence and sleeping habits. ¶ Going to bed at a different time each night affected girls more than boys, but both fared worse on mental tasks than children who had a set bedtime, researchers found."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "both",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbfc8f66-b822-3b7a-8212-fad1b489a554",
                                        "entry_id": "e9d65790-e9f0-3861-8c35-1e19417c6ab2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Including both of (used with and)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05a750db-6906-46b0-8e7e-847371849819",
                                                "sense_id": "fbfc8f66-b822-3b7a-8212-fad1b489a554",
                                                "text": "I (can) both sing and dance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20cc8c7a-8c7c-41ba-915f-509c3e76c99b",
                                                "sense_id": "fbfc8f66-b822-3b7a-8212-fad1b489a554",
                                                "text": "Both you and I are students."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55f691f2-ef67-425d-832f-423d51127373",
                                                "sense_id": "fbfc8f66-b822-3b7a-8212-fad1b489a554",
                                                "text": "Mind you, clothes were clothes in those days. There was a great deal of them, lavish both in material and in workmanship."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e07df8a0-c18d-30c0-be29-a33d5a71db47",
                                        "entry_id": "e9d65790-e9f0-3861-8c35-1e19417c6ab2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Including all of (used with and)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a236a641-6940-4540-bf23-85d274d9aa80",
                                                "sense_id": "e07df8a0-c18d-30c0-be29-a33d5a71db47",
                                                "text": "[…] having much aduantage both in number, valure, and forepreparation […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29c58758-8d41-4706-9dd9-3fffd10dbd80",
                                                "sense_id": "e07df8a0-c18d-30c0-be29-a33d5a71db47",
                                                "text": "Both mongrel, puppy, whelp, and hound."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f623bdd-0a6b-4767-b562-b523b963eaf9",
                                                "sense_id": "e07df8a0-c18d-30c0-be29-a33d5a71db47",
                                                "text": "He prayeth well who loveth well both man and bird and beast."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e99f2ab1-925b-4c29-968b-1e262f53e226",
                                                "sense_id": "e07df8a0-c18d-30c0-be29-a33d5a71db47",
                                                "text": "[…] as he appreciates its beauty and its rich gifts, as he regards it with venerant love, fed by both his intellectual powers, his contemplation, and his meditation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "092a796d-2d0b-4c33-b20f-4794cc71fd7d",
                        "source_entry_id": "e0f0f1c5-220e-33d8-bf41-ef2bf3f4f3c1",
                        "source_sense_id": "4dd18e83-3f45-3471-a923-6456caa58588",
                        "source_sense_description": "evenzeer",
                        "target_lang_word": "autant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "autant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "21b8978e-2277-3318-af3c-070936b2a5a3",
                                        "entry_id": "a53f0997-43eb-3061-b044-b0dc542a3050",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marque l’égalité de quantité, de valeur ou de nombre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bc7f8d8-9f9c-4dd2-a2ed-a79cdf534d5f",
                                                "sense_id": "21b8978e-2277-3318-af3c-070936b2a5a3",
                                                "text": "Je peux en faire autant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51cc1549-c0d4-4142-a1ea-3dc4092702c8",
                                                "sense_id": "21b8978e-2277-3318-af3c-070936b2a5a3",
                                                "text": "Il est autant pressé que toi. — Note : L’utilisation devant un adjectif est parfois contestée, bien que relativement courante. Dans ce cas, il vaudrait mieux utiliser aussi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5364f5d9-1416-4f8a-a2ad-55b275f55098",
                                                "sense_id": "21b8978e-2277-3318-af3c-070936b2a5a3",
                                                "text": "Le rezzou comprendrait un millier d'hommes avec deux fois autant de chameaux de selle et de bât."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e3a8d9f-6ede-4cac-a0bb-3a8655b8eb4e",
                                                "sense_id": "21b8978e-2277-3318-af3c-070936b2a5a3",
                                                "text": "Il n’y a pas que les Forces armées canadiennes qui sont secouées par une grave crise de leadership à la suite d’allégations d’inconduite sexuelle à l’égard de deux chefs d’état-major en quelques semaines.\n Nos gouvernements le sont tout autant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60e994b2-a511-4bff-b4b4-f4bee880f703",
                                                "sense_id": "21b8978e-2277-3318-af3c-070936b2a5a3",
                                                "text": "Ce diamant vaut autant que ce rubis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ec4773c-27ff-367a-b052-398c0dffdfa8",
                                        "entry_id": "a53f0997-43eb-3061-b044-b0dc542a3050",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Un nombre ou une quantité également beaucoup de."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Avec de"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c044653-99fb-4772-ad63-59a10b377367",
                                                "sense_id": "5ec4773c-27ff-367a-b052-398c0dffdfa8",
                                                "text": "J’étais à Belgrade du 2 au 4 octobre 1914. A cette date, les Autrichiens avaient bombardé la ville pendant trente-six jours et autant de nuits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02b0d69b-6e4a-448c-9956-ed6e8ca1845e",
                                                "sense_id": "5ec4773c-27ff-367a-b052-398c0dffdfa8",
                                                "text": "Il y a autant de rangs de pommes de terre que de rangs de carottes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa398372-bc6b-47cd-b37d-5f5dd5ae5a6c",
                                                "sense_id": "5ec4773c-27ff-367a-b052-398c0dffdfa8",
                                                "text": "Toutes ces promesses sont autant de mensonges."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ba1a0c5-d13a-46c5-a764-9fa3906c6d8d",
                                                "sense_id": "5ec4773c-27ff-367a-b052-398c0dffdfa8",
                                                "text": "IBM, Apple, Dior,… Autant d'icônes qui ont marqué notre époque."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d873f09b-73f1-38d1-963a-5f4a25841928",
                                        "entry_id": "a53f0997-43eb-3061-b044-b0dc542a3050",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Aussi bien."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fce8575-0330-4d5e-abfc-dc782e962c21",
                                                "sense_id": "d873f09b-73f1-38d1-963a-5f4a25841928",
                                                "text": "Alors, qu'attendez-vous pour fixer la date de notre mariage ? Si vous continuez à la renvoyer aux calendes grecques, autant vaudrait décider qu'il ne se fera jamais."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e297325d-97cc-4193-8782-4f071d7514a7",
                                                "sense_id": "d873f09b-73f1-38d1-963a-5f4a25841928",
                                                "text": "Colossale unité : l'ancienne unité internationale vaut 16,17 nanokatals. Autant exprimer les mensurations d'un top model en milles nautiques. Le katal n'est toujours pas entré dans les mœurs des laboratoires d'analyse biologiques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a7736f1-675f-4a67-9ea2-26bb8ec1281c",
                                                "sense_id": "d873f09b-73f1-38d1-963a-5f4a25841928",
                                                "text": "Elle n'avait en rien conforté la thèse du rédacteur en chef, considérant leur rencontre au salon de thé comme une tentative de manipulation par un pseudo-privé en manque de clientèle et qui avançait des révélations sans la queue d'une preuve. Autant dire, intox, bidon, pipeau et couille de loup dans le jargon professionnel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
